WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.560 --> 00:00:05.800
The last training session before the match.

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:10.690
Gum is only 13 years old, but he’s already
a fighter.

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:13.730
I’m never scared.

00:00:13.730 --> 00:00:15.210
I always hit hard.

00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:22.820
I like to use my knees, that’s my main weapon,
I’m good with my knees.

00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:29.320
Like many at this gym in Thailand’s poor
Northeast, Gum has a troubled family background.

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:33.320
His parents are divorced, his grandparents
can’t take care of him.

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.520
That’s how he ended up here.

00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:43.620
He eats, sleeps, and of course trains here
– in return he fights, for money.

00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:47.810
Our boxers are taking part in a lot of fights.

00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:51.110
Part of the money they win goes to the gym.

00:00:51.110 --> 00:00:58.220
That’s how we keep things running and how
we can take care of the kids.

00:00:58.220 --> 00:01:05.850
Muay Thai, or Thai boxing, is a national sport
in Thailand.

00:01:05.850 --> 00:01:10.259
It’s hugely popular, also among children.

00:01:10.259 --> 00:01:12.509
But the risk of injury is high.

00:01:12.509 --> 00:01:17.530
Recently, a 13-year old died after being knocked
out in a fight.

00:01:17.530 --> 00:01:21.400
Many parents downplay the risks involved.

00:01:21.400 --> 00:01:25.420
I think there’s very little effect on the
brain.

00:01:25.420 --> 00:01:32.570
If there was brain damage, I would know from
the behavior change after the fight.

00:01:32.570 --> 00:01:35.960
But I’ve never seen that before.

00:01:35.960 --> 00:01:42.039
But biggest danger is hidden from plain sight.

00:01:42.039 --> 00:01:43.909
These punches are pretty hard.

00:01:43.909 --> 00:01:49.070
On average, fighters like Gum will deliver
20 to 40 of these to their opponent's head

00:01:49.070 --> 00:01:50.070
in one round.

00:01:50.070 --> 00:01:54.409
And every time the brain suffers a minor injury.

00:01:54.409 --> 00:01:59.179
Over the years those injuries add up and that
can have devastating consequences.

00:01:59.179 --> 00:02:05.600
Dr. Jiraporn Laothamatas has been studying
the effects repeated punches to the head have

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:08.810
on children’s brains.

00:02:08.810 --> 00:02:13.959
The mechanism is chronic repeated minor brain
injury.

00:02:13.959 --> 00:02:20.140
It causes the dysfunction of the brain and
we found out that there is a decreased memory

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:22.650
function, decreased IQ.

00:02:22.650 --> 00:02:30.340
This is dangerous because he can go to school,
he can sing, he can play, and nobody, if you

00:02:30.340 --> 00:02:33.840
look from the outside will know that he has
a brain injury.

00:02:33.840 --> 00:02:38.980
That’s why all the parents all say they
don’t see that anything’s wrong with their

00:02:38.980 --> 00:02:39.980
kids.

00:02:39.980 --> 00:02:46.530
She's calling for banning fights for children
under 12 - and no full contact before they’re

00:02:46.530 --> 00:02:47.780
15.

00:02:47.780 --> 00:02:54.700
But in reality, kids even younger excite the
crowds all over Thailand.

00:02:54.700 --> 00:03:04.730
For Gum, it’s fight night.

00:03:04.730 --> 00:03:10.160
If he does well, he hopes one day he can make
it big and box in the capital, Bangkok.

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:12.569
That’s where the money is.

00:03:12.569 --> 00:03:15.790
But first he has to win here.

00:03:15.790 --> 00:03:24.500
But it’s not going so well for Gum.

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:31.349
After five rounds, his opponent wins on points.

00:03:31.349 --> 00:03:34.090
My arms weren’t strong enough, he was simply
better.

00:03:34.090 --> 00:03:35.519
I’m very sad.

00:03:35.519 --> 00:03:39.879
I have to train harder.

00:03:39.879 --> 00:03:45.290
He’ll be back another day.

00:03:45.290 --> 00:03:51.079
For Gum, like many youngsters in Thailand,
boxing is a shot at a better life.

00:03:51.079 --> 00:03:55.060
But one that could come at a high price.

